// "Expend reserves of vitality to knit wounds" -- a self-heal, not a
// lingering buff. No "expend Hit Dice" resource exists in this engine, so
// this is modeled as a short, strong `Regeneration` burst (same primitive
// goodberry.ron/vitalic_font.ron already use for restorative auras, scaled
// here for a single dedicated self-heal rather than a shared group trickle):
// 7.0 HP/s for 4s = 28 HP delivered fast enough to read as "instant"
// recovery even though `Regeneration` itself always ticks over time.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    cast_duration: 0.3,
    recover_duration: 0.35,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: Regeneration, data: BuffData(strength: 7.0, duration: Some(4.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 35.0,
    meta: (school: Some(Abjuration), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
